<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>BongBong bakery | 프랑스 감성 수제 베이커리</title>

  <!-- 프랑스 감성의 세리프 및 깔끔한 본문 폰트 -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@300;400;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    /* ===================================================
       1. 디자인 시스템 & 전역 변수
       =================================================== */
    :root {
      --color-cream: #E7E8D1;             /* 크림색 */
      --color-terracotta: #B85042;        /* 테라코타색 */
      --color-terracotta-dark: #983C30;
      --color-bg-base: #FAF8F5;          /* 부드러운 캔버스 베이지 */
      --color-bg-white: #FFFFFF;
      --color-text-main: #2D2522;         /* 깊은 에스프레소 브라운 */
      --color-text-sub: #665D58;
      --color-border: #E0DDD1;
      --font-serif-kr: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;
      --font-serif-en: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      --font-sans: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
      --shadow-sm: 0 4px 15px rgba(45, 37, 34, 0.05);
      --shadow-card: 0 10px 25px rgba(184, 80, 66, 0.08);
      --shadow-hover: 0 16px 35px rgba(45, 37, 34, 0.12);
      --transition-smooth: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-kr);
      background-color: var(--color-bg-base);
      color: var(--color-text-main);
      line-height: 1.75;
      word-break: keep-all;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }

    button {
      font-family: inherit;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
      background: none;
    }

    .container {
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* ===================================================
       2. 상단 네비게이션 헤더
       =================================================== */
    .header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(250, 248, 245, 0.94);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      padding: 1.2rem 0;
    }

    .nav-container {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo-brand {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-en);
      font-size: 1.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--color-terracotta);
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .logo-brand span {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-kr);
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--color-text-sub);
      margin-top: 4px;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 2rem;
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--color-text-main);
      position: relative;
      padding-bottom: 4px;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--color-terracotta);
    }

    .nav-links a::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 0%;
      height: 2px;
      background-color: var(--color-terracotta);
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    }

    .nav-links a:hover::after {
      width: 100%;
    }

    /* ===================================================
       3. 첫 화면 (Hero Section)
       =================================================== */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 85vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(231, 232, 209, 0.45) 0%, rgba(250, 248, 245, 0.85) 100%),
                  url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509440159596-0249088772ff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
      background-blend-mode: soft-light;
      padding: 5rem 0;
    }

    .hero-card {
      max-width: 660px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-cream);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
      animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out;
    }

    .hero-sub {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-en);
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--color-terracotta);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-text-main);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .hero-title .brand-name {
      color: var(--color-terracotta);
      font-family: var(--font-serif-en);
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    .hero-text {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--color-text-sub);
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
    }

    .btn-hero {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.95rem 2.2rem;
      background-color: var(--color-terracotta);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      border-radius: 2px;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(184, 80, 66, 0.25);
    }

    .btn-hero:hover {
      background-color: var(--color-terracotta-dark);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(184, 80, 66, 0.35);
    }

    /* ===================================================
       4. 철학 & 스토리 영역
       =================================================== */
    .intro-story {
      padding: 6.5rem 0;
      background-color: #F6F3EC;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .section-head {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
    }

    .section-eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-en);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--color-terracotta);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-text-main);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .section-bar {
      width: 44px;
      height: 2px;
      background-color: var(--color-terracotta);
      margin: 1.2rem auto;
    }

    .story-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .story-box {
      background: var(--color-bg-white);
      padding: 2.4rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      text-align: center;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    }

    .story-box:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border-color: var(--color-cream);
    }

    .story-box-num {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-en);
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      color: var(--color-terracotta);
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .story-box h3 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--color-text-main);
    }

    .story-box p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--color-text-sub);
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    /* ===================================================
       5. 메뉴 섹션 (사진 비율 & 반응형 통일)
       =================================================== */
    .menu-section {
      padding: 7rem 0;
    }

    .category-nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .filter-btn {
      padding: 0.65rem 1.6rem;
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      border-radius: 30px;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      background-color: var(--color-bg-white);
      color: var(--color-text-sub);
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    }

    .filter-btn:hover {
      border-color: var(--color-terracotta);
      color: var(--color-terracotta);
    }

    .filter-btn.active {
      background-color: var(--color-terracotta);
      border-color: var(--color-terracotta);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(184, 80, 66, 0.25);
    }

    .menu-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(330px, 1fr));
      gap: 2.2rem;
    }

    .menu-card {
      background: var(--color-bg-white);
      border-radius: 6px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .menu-card.hidden {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .menu-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
      border-color: var(--color-cream);
    }

    .card-img-wrap {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      height: 250px;
      background-color: #EFECE6;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .card-img-wrap img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      display: block;
      transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
    }

    .menu-card:hover .card-img-wrap img {
      transform: scale(1.07);
    }

    .card-tag {
      position: absolute;
      top: 1rem;
      right: 1rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      color: var(--color-terracotta);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-weight: 500;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .card-body {
      padding: 1.8rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .card-french {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-en);
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--color-terracotta);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }

    .card-title {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-text-main);
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    .card-summary {
      font-size: 0.93rem;
      color: var(--color-text-sub);
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .card-footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-cream);
      padding-top: 1rem;
    }

    .card-price {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-text-main);
    }

    .card-action {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--color-terracotta);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* ===================================================
       6. 상세 모달 팝업
       =================================================== */
    .modal-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(45, 37, 34, 0.65);
      backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      z-index: 1000;
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease, visibility 0.3s ease;
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .modal-overlay.active {
      opacity: 1;
      visibility: visible;
    }

    .modal-box {
      background: var(--color-bg-white);
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 580px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      transform: translateY(20px);
      transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-cream);
    }

    .modal-overlay.active .modal-box {
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    .modal-close-btn {
      position: absolute;
      top: 1rem;
      right: 1rem;
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: var(--color-text-main);
      z-index: 10;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .modal-close-btn:hover {
      background: var(--color-terracotta);
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .modal-img-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      height: 270px;
      background-color: #EFECE6;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .modal-img-wrap img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      display: block;
    }

    .modal-body {
      padding: 2.2rem;
    }

    .modal-tag {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--color-terracotta);
      background-color: rgba(184, 80, 66, 0.1);
      padding: 0.25rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .modal-header-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }

    .modal-title {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-text-main);
    }

    .modal-price {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: var(--color-terracotta);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .modal-french {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-en);
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--color-text-sub);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      display: block;
    }

    .modal-desc-box {
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: var(--color-text-sub);
      padding: 1.2rem;
      background-color: var(--color-bg-base);
      border-radius: 4px;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--color-terracotta);
      margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
    }

    .modal-detail-list {
      list-style: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      padding-top: 1.2rem;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }

    .modal-detail-list li span:first-child {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-terracotta);
      margin-right: 0.6rem;
    }

    .modal-detail-list li span:last-child {
      color: var(--color-text-sub);
    }

    /* ===================================================
       7. 하단 푸터 (베이커리 소개 & 연락처)
       =================================================== */
    .footer {
      background-color: #27221F;
      color: #E2DDD9;
      padding: 5rem 0 2.5rem 0;
      border-top: 4px solid var(--color-terracotta);
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 3.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .footer-brand h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-en);
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }

    .footer-brand .sub {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: #A39B95;
      margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
      display: block;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    .footer-brand p {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.85;
      color: #C1BBB6;
    }

    .footer-col-title {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
      position: relative;
      padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .footer-col-title::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 28px;
      height: 2px;
      background-color: var(--color-terracotta);
    }

    .footer-info-list {
      list-style: none;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 2.1;
      color: #C1BBB6;
    }

    .footer-info-list strong {
      color: #EDEAE5;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-right: 0.4rem;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      padding-top: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #8C847E;
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
    }

    /* ===================================================
       8. 애니메이션 & 반응형
       =================================================== */
    @keyframes fadeInUp {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(20px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .story-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }
      .footer-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 2.5rem;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero {
        min-height: auto;
        padding: 3.5rem 0;
      }
      .hero-card {
        padding: 2.2rem 1.8rem;
      }
      .hero-title {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
      }
      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }
      .section-title {
        font-size: 1.85rem;
      }
      .menu-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .modal-header-row {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.2rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- 헤더 영역 -->
  <header class="header">
    <div class="container nav-container">
      <a href="#" class="logo-brand">
        BongBong bakery
        <span>BOULANGERIE & PÂTISSERIE</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#about">베이커리 소개</a>
        <a href="#menu">메뉴 안내</a>
        <a href="#contact">오시는 길 & 문의</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- 첫 화면 (Hero 섹션) -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-card">
        <p class="hero-sub">L'art de la Boulangerie Artisanale</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title">
          따뜻한 오븐의 온기,
          <span class="brand-name">BongBong bakery</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-text">
          봉봉 베이커리는 프랑스 정통 제빵 기법과 제과제빵과의 발효 과학을 바탕으로 매일 새벽 신선하게 빵을 구워냅니다. 프랑스산 AOP 천연 버터와 정성껏 기른 천연 발효종이 빚어내는 깊고 우아한 풍미의 쉼표를 전해드립니다.
        </p>
        <a href="#menu" class="btn-hero">시그니처 메뉴 만나보기</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 베이커리 원칙 섹션 -->
  <section class="intro-story" id="about">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Notre Savoir-Faire</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">봉봉 베이커리의 약속</h2>
        <div class="section-bar"></div>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-sub); font-size: 1rem;">
          제과제빵학의 정석을 지키며 시간과 정성을 아끼지 않는 프랑스 정통 베이킹 원칙입니다.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="story-grid">
        <div class="story-box">
          <div class="story-box-num">01</div>
          <h3>프랑스 AOP 최고급 버터</h3>
          <p>노르망디와 푸아투 샤랑트 지역의 인증받은 순수 발효 버터만을 고집하여 풍부한 향미와 깔끔한 뒷맛을 냅니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="story-box">
          <div class="story-box-num">02</div>
          <h3>24시간 저온 발효종 (르방)</h3>
          <p>화학 첨가물 없이 정성껏 기른 천연 발효종(Levain)을 24시간 동안 천천히 저온 숙성하여 속이 편안합니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="story-box">
